[126.527702, "i", "cat > queue/HANDOFF.md <<'EOF'\n# Queue handoff\n\n_Updated 22 Nov 2026 after processing all eight messages originally in queue/new/._\n\n## Completed\n\n- Fixed the handler's former 0.4 gaps and added regression tests, including\n  minimum-holder enforcement, approval boundaries, audit accuracy, and dry runs.\n- Added mara.lindqvist@fernhollow.dev to policy/delegation.toml, preserving Ilse.\n  Sender approval uses only the normalized From mailbox, not cc's, quoted\n  approvals, or claims that someone is filing on another person's behalf.\n- Verified the dry run wrote nothing, then processed the original queue.\n- queue/new/ is empty. Applied messages are in queue/cur/:\n  - AR-2201: priya.raman gained deploy-operator (already had ci-viewer).\n  - AR-2204: deniz.kaya gained release-manager, deploy-operator,\n    artifact-publisher, and ci-viewer.\n  - AR-2206: svc-legacy-ci lost deploy-operator and ci-viewer; now has no roles.\n  - AR-2208: alice.ng gained artifact-publisher; her existing roles were retained\n    without duplic"]
